## 3. Tabulation (Bottom-Up)

```python
class Solution:
    def longestCommonSubsequence(self, s1, s2):
        n = len(s1)
        m = len(s2)

        dp = [[0] * (m + 1) for _ in range(n + 1)]

        for i in range(1, n + 1):
            for j in range(1, m + 1):
                if s1[i - 1] == s2[j - 1]:
                    dp[i][j] = 1 + dp[i - 1][j - 1]
                else:
                    dp[i][j] = max(
                        dp[i - 1][j],
                        dp[i][j - 1]
                    )

        return dp[n][m]
```

**TC:** O(n × m)
**SC:** O(n × m)

